version: "1.0.0"

license: Apache-2.0

abstract: >
  Goal-Oriented Training Data Organization (GTDO) introduces
  a structural approach to AI computation by organizing
  training data according to future computational goals.
  The repository develops Goal Functions, Brain Units,
  Dispatch Trees, Calling Graphs, Call Paths,
  localized Runtime optimization,
  and Structural Security Infrastructure,
  establishing an organizational foundation
  for trustworthy Runtime AI.

